1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,653
You've made it to the final lesson!

2
00:00:02,653 --> 00:00:04,929
You've seen everything Kyntlo can do.

3
00:00:04,929 --> 00:00:06,774
Now let's turn it into a plan.

4
00:00:06,774 --> 00:00:11,880
Over the next 30 days, you'll set things
up in the order that gets results fastest,

5
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,541
one focused week at a time.

6
00:00:14,391 --> 00:00:15,901
Here's the shape of it.

7
00:00:15,901 --> 00:00:17,346
Week one, foundations.

8
00:00:17,346 --> 00:00:19,053
Week two, capturing leads.

9
00:00:19,053 --> 00:00:21,154
Week three, automated follow-up.

10
00:00:21,154 --> 00:00:22,598
And week four, growth.

11
00:00:22,598 --> 00:00:25,881
Each week builds on the
last, so don't skip ahead.

12
00:00:25,881 --> 00:00:28,639
Fifteen to thirty minutes a day is enough.

13
00:00:29,502 --> 00:00:30,958
Week one is foundations.

14
00:00:30,958 --> 00:00:34,659
Nothing here is glamorous, but
everything else depends on it.

15
00:00:35,518 --> 00:00:36,999
Start with the Launchpad.

16
00:00:36,999 --> 00:00:40,377
Work through the checklist:
connect your email and phone,

17
00:00:40,377 --> 00:00:42,096
and link Google and Facebook.

18
00:00:42,096 --> 00:00:46,244
Then, in Settings, complete your
business profile, set your time zone,

19
00:00:46,244 --> 00:00:47,488
and invite your team.

20
00:00:48,361 --> 00:00:52,412
End the week by importing your
existing customers into Contacts.

21
00:00:52,412 --> 00:00:57,412
Tag them as you import, for example past
patients, so you can reach them later.

22
00:00:57,412 --> 00:01:00,576
Only import people who've
agreed to hear from you.

23
00:01:01,429 --> 00:01:06,042
Week two is about capturing every lead,
so nobody who's interested slips away.

24
00:01:06,939 --> 00:01:11,630
Build one funnel from a template, around
your best offer, with one form on it.

25
00:01:11,630 --> 00:01:15,540
Add the chat widget to your website,
so visitors can message you.

26
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:19,088
Then set up a booking calendar
with your real availability,

27
00:01:19,088 --> 00:01:20,652
and link to it everywhere.

28
00:01:21,507 --> 00:01:24,485
Week three is where Kyntlo
starts working while you sleep.

29
00:01:24,485 --> 00:01:26,026
You'll automate the follow-up.

30
00:01:26,877 --> 00:01:29,326
Build three workflows, in this order.

31
00:01:29,326 --> 00:01:32,107
First, an instant reply to every new lead.

32
00:01:32,107 --> 00:01:34,093
Second, missed call text back.

33
00:01:34,093 --> 00:01:37,205
Third, appointment
confirmations and reminders.

34
00:01:37,205 --> 00:01:41,375
Set up your pipeline too, and
let workflows move deals forward.

35
00:01:41,375 --> 00:01:44,553
Test each one on yourself
before you publish it.

36
00:01:45,402 --> 00:01:46,951
Week four is about growth.

37
00:01:46,951 --> 00:01:50,586
With the basics running, you
can now bring in more customers.

38
00:01:51,505 --> 00:01:55,804
Switch on automatic review
requests, and reply to every review.

39
00:01:55,804 --> 00:02:00,990
Send a reactivation campaign to the
past customers you imported in week one.

40
00:02:00,990 --> 00:02:06,449
And explore AI: a chatbot that answers
common questions can take a real load off

41
00:02:06,449 --> 00:02:07,132
your team.

42
00:02:07,982 --> 00:02:10,421
After 30 days, keep three weekly habits.

43
00:02:10,421 --> 00:02:12,921
Check your dashboard and conversion rate.

44
00:02:12,921 --> 00:02:16,457
Look at your workflow logs for
anything skipped or failed.

45
00:02:16,457 --> 00:02:18,225
And read your newest reviews.

46
00:02:18,225 --> 00:02:21,457
Twenty minutes a week keeps
the whole system healthy.

47
00:02:22,306 --> 00:02:23,829
Here's my last pro tip.

48
00:02:23,829 --> 00:02:25,087
Done beats perfect.

49
00:02:25,087 --> 00:02:30,516
A simple workflow that's live today will
win you more customers than a perfect one

50
00:02:30,516 --> 00:02:31,973
you finish next month.

51
00:02:31,973 --> 00:02:35,218
Launch, watch the results,
and improve as you go.

52
00:02:36,068 --> 00:02:38,043
And that's the end of the course.

53
00:02:38,043 --> 00:02:40,378
Thank you so much for learning with us!

54
00:02:40,378 --> 00:02:43,610
Come back to any lesson
whenever you need a refresher,

55
00:02:43,610 --> 00:02:46,184
use Ask AI inside Kyntlo
for quick answers,

56
00:02:46,184 --> 00:02:50,015
and reach out to the Kyntlo support
team whenever you get stuck.

57
00:02:50,015 --> 00:02:52,170
We can't wait to see what you build.

58
00:02:52,170 --> 00:02:52,768
Good luck!
